  "releaseNotes": "Enigma.Logging.NLog 1.0.0 — initial release. Build NLog-backed Microsoft.Extensions.Logging loggers with a fluent target builder and a disposable, flushable LoggerHandle (console/colored-console/file/database/debug targets, level-range + logger-name-pattern gating, IServiceCollection DI helper). Supersedes the retired NLogLoggerBuilder package (new identity, no upgrade path). See RELEASENOTES.md for the full details.",
